   └─ ✋ blocked by constraints

✋ ConstraintError: duct.refresh --home names one duct's own tree, so it cannot ride --all
   └─ fix: rhx duct.refresh --on <tree>/<role> --home <tree dir>   # one duct, its home said aloud"
`;

exports[`supervisor.surface acceptance (as consumer) given: [case3] the journeys this repo adds, run by name from a consumer when: [t7] duct.refresh with --home handed no value then: the render matches the snapshot 1`] = `
